<title>INDONESIA: Jakarta stock exchange closed on year-end holiday.</title>
<headline>Jakarta stock exchange closed on year-end holiday.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Jakarta stock exchange is closed on Tuesday due to the year-end holiday.</p>
<p>The exchange will resume trading on Thursday, January 2 after it concluded the year's trading on Friday.</p>
<p>The Jakarta composite index rose 4.94 points, or 0.78 percent, to close at 637.43 points on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
